{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43201","headline":"晚望 · 林琨","name":"晚望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清晨孤亭里，极目对前岑。\n远与天水合，长霞生夕林。\n苍然平楚意，杳霭半秋阴。\n落日川上尽，关城云外深。\n方予事岩壑，及此欲抽簪。\n诗就蓬山道，还兹契宿心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林琨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}